<title>GERMANY: Metallgesellschaft to sell Jewometaal.</title>
<headline>Metallgesellschaft to sell Jewometaal.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>German diversified industrial group Metallgesellschaft AG said on Thursday that it had reached agreement to sell its Jewometaal Stainless Processing BV unit to a unit of German group Haniel &amp; Cie.</p>
<p>Metallgesellschaft said that cartel office authorities still needed to approve the deal, which was part of Metallgesellschaft's strategy to focus on core activities.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
